<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>STICK WITH ME</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">The Kid LAROI</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">THE FIRST TIME (DELUXE VERSION)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">3ALRBJsse1uiDIVY7SrRux</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.840" end="00:23.100">Call me when it's late in the night time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.100" end="00:25.610">That's the only time I ever make time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.610" end="00:27.730">I don't like to text and be on facetime</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.730" end="00:30.430">You say I ain't sh1t but that you love me at the same time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.430" end="00:32.650">At the same time, baby at the same time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.650" end="00:35.410">I don't wanna waste yours but you could erase mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.410" end="00:37.620">I been thinking about you ever since you came by</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.620" end="00:42.890">Been with plenty women girl but none give me the same high</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.890" end="00:45.300">Up early 10am we on rodeo drive</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.300" end="00:47.900">Spend a bag cuz i got it i dont fake mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.900" end="00:49.400">Fxvk whatever that they say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.950" end="00:52.320">Baby take my, word, it's fine, I'm just tired</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.320" end="00:53.820">Sorry if i'm quiet</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.700" end="00:56.860">I know that sh1t that you be on so do not play me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.860" end="00:59.170">There's not a lot in this world that can phase me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.170" end="01:01.650">So baby stick with me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.650" end="01:04.220">Whether I'm right or whether I'm wrong</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.220" end="01:06.540">Baby stick with me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.540" end="01:09.040">Whether my money long or there's nothing at all</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.040" end="01:11.270">Would you stick with me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.270" end="01:14.050">It's nobody like you, you know if I'm true</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.050" end="01:16.470">Girl it just hit me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.470" end="01:17.970">Baby stick with me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.930" end="01:19.430">Baby stick with me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.890" end="01:20.390">Baby stick</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.800" end="01:22.060">And I know that everybody else left in the dark</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.060" end="01:24.230">And I know they run around with my name in they mouth</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.230" end="01:26.640">But they never act the same or insane when I'm out</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.640" end="01:29.160">And a lot was actin' strange when they came, now they out</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.160" end="01:32.080">Dropped the brains out the coupe, but she my main and she flew</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.080" end="01:34.400">Ask her how she came, private plane when she flew</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.400" end="01:36.720">It's a different level, girl I changed how you move</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.720" end="01:39.820">All I ask is the truth, I do the same thing to you and it's</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.820" end="01:41.710">Security in the black truck downstairs</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.710" end="01:44.420">I still can't believe how insane my life is</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.420" end="01:46.910">I still can't believe how you changed my life and</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.910" end="01:48.590">Can you stay right here? (Right here)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.590" end="01:51.270">So baby stick with me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.270" end="01:53.830">Whether I'm right or whether I'm wrong</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.830" end="01:56.170">Baby stick with me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.170" end="01:58.700">Whether my money long or there's nothing at all</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.700" end="02:00.860">Would you stick with me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.860" end="02:03.660">It's nobody like you, you know if I'm true</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.660" end="02:06.090">Girl it just hit me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.090" end="02:07.590">Baby stick with me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.480" end="02:08.980">Baby stick with me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.630" end="02:12.630">Baby stick</p></div></body></tt>